# Local security exception for SkillEvaluator 3fd2cf57e4a2af01f282e001f7515b6e76f18ec7.
# Its llm extra requires >=1.92.0,<1.94.0.dev0. This exact override intentionally
# conflicts with the upstream metadata, which remains unchanged.
# uv overrides replace every parent's LiteLLM constraint. install_evaluator.py
# checks all dependencies required by the selected extras. It allows an exception
# only for that exact evaluator requirement.
# uv pip check does not activate extras, so it cannot establish metadata consistency.
# Tests without credentials exercised the evaluator's Bedrock invoke/converse
# calls and Harbor's LiteLLM calls. They mocked only provider HTTP.
# These tests do not establish live-model compatibility.
# Use make refresh-evaluator-locks; review targeted updates with
# tools/refresh_evaluator_locks.py --upgrade-package package==version.
litellm==1.101.3
